<BaseLayout
  title="Fee update process (summary)"
  description="Public summary of how FeeCalc Tools updates payment fee schedules and verification dates."
  canonicalPath="/docs-fee-update/"
>
  <h1>Fee update process</h1>
  <p class="answer-first">
    Maintainers update <code>src/data/fees.ts</code>, refresh last-verified dates, run unit tests, and note material
    changes in page “Last updated” fields. Full checklist lives in the repo at <code>docs/FEE-UPDATE.md</code>.
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the official pricing URL for the schedule.</li>
    <li>Update percent, fixed, currency, notes, sourceUrl, lastVerified.</li>
    <li>Bump <code>FEE_DATA_VERSION</code> / <code>FEE_DATA_UPDATED</code> when material.</li>
    <li>Run <code>npm test</code> and <code>npm run build</code>.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>See also <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
